                "text": "## Create a new project\n\n```\nduxt create <project-name>\n```\n\nOptions:\n- `--mode=static` (default) — Static site, no server needed\n- `--mode=server` — Full-stack with ORM and API routes\n- `--template=minimal` (default) or `--template=full`\n- `--directory=<path>` — Where to create the project\n\n---\n\n## Start development server\n\n```\nduxt dev\nduxt dev --port 9090  # Custom port\n```\n\nStarts a hot-reload dev server (default port 8080). Watches for file changes and rebuilds automatically.\n\n### Running multiple apps simultaneously\n\nUse different ports for each app:\n```\n# Terminal 1\ncd app1 && duxt dev --port 8080\n\n# Terminal 2\ncd app2 && duxt dev --port 9090\n```\n\nEach app uses 5 ports starting from the base port (proxy, api, jaspr, webdev, jaspr-proxy)."
