            "type": "text",
            "text": "Implement the following plan:\n\n# Plan: REST API with Session-Based Authentication (Duxt/Dart)\n\n## Context\n\nBuild a Todo REST API with session-based authentication in a Duxt (Dart) server project at `/Users/flakerimi/TMP/todo` (currently empty). The API will have user registration/login, session cookies, and per-user todo CRUD.\n\n**Note:** This directory is NOT a git repository. I'll ask before making changes so nothing is lost.\n\n---\n\n## API Endpoints\n\n| Method | Endpoint | Auth? | Description |\n|--------|----------|-------|-------------|\n| POST | `/api/auth/register` | No | Register new user |\n| POST | `/api/auth/login` | No | Login, get session cookie |\n| POST | `/api/auth/logout` | Yes | Destroy session |\n| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Yes | Get current user |\n| GET | `/api/todos` | Yes | List user's todos |\n| POST | `/api/todos` | Yes | Create a todo |\n| GET | `/api/todos/:id` | Yes | Get a todo |\n| PUT | `/api/todos/:id` | Yes | Update a todo |\n| DELETE | `/api/todos/:id` | Yes | Delete a todo |\n\n---\n\n## Implementation Steps\n\n### Step 1: Scaffold the project\n```bash\ncd /Users/flakerimi/TMP\nduxt create todo --mode=server\n```\nThen add `dbcrypt` (bcrypt hashing) and `uuid` (session tokens) to `pubspec.yaml` and run `dart pub get`.\n\n### Step 2: Create 3 models in `lib/models/`\n\n- **User** (`user.dart`) — `email`, `password` (hashed), `name` + a `toSafeMap()` that excludes password\n- **Todo** (`todo.dart`) — `title`, `completed` (bool), `user_id` (int)\n- **Session** (`session.dart`) — `token`, `user_id`, `expires_at` + an `isExpired` getter\n\nAll use Duxt ORM's `Model` base class with `tableName`, `schema`, `fromMap`, `toMap`. Tables are auto-migrated on server start.\n\n### Step 3: Create utilities in `server/utils/`\n\n- **`password.dart`** — `PasswordHelper.hash(password)` / `PasswordHelper.verify(password, hash)` using bcrypt (12 rounds)\n- **`session_manager.dart`** — `createSession(userId)` returns token, `getUserFromToken(token)` returns User or null, `deleteSession(token)` for logout. Sessions are stored in DB, expire after 24h.\n\n### Step 4: Create auth middleware in `server/middleware/`\n\n- **`auth_middleware.dart`** — Extracts `session_token` cookie, validates via `SessionManager`, attaches `User` to `req.context['user']`. Returns 401 if invalid.\n\n### Step 5: Create API routes in `server/api/`\n\n- **`auth.dart`** — Register (validate input, check duplicate email, hash password, create user + session, set cookie), Login (verify password, create session), Logout (delete session, expire cookie), Me (return current user)\n- **`todos.dart`** — Full CRUD, every handler calls `authMiddleware` first, all queries scoped to `user_id`. Ownership check returns 404 (not 403) to avoid leaking info.\n\nCookie flags: `HttpOnly; SameSite=Strict; Path=/; Max-Age=86400`\n\n### Step 6: Wire up in `server/main.dart`\n\nRegister both `registerAuthApi(server)` and `registerTodoApi(server)`, then `server.start()`.\n\n---\n\n## Files to Create/Modify (10 files)\n\n```\ntodo/\n├── pubspec.yaml                          # Add dbcrypt, uuid deps\n├── lib/models/\n│   ├── user.dart                         # User model + toSafeMap()\n│   ├── todo.dart                         # Todo model with user_id\n│   └── session.dart                      # Session model with isExpired\n├── server/\n│   ├── main.dart                         # Wire up API registrations\n│   ├── api/\n│   │   ├── auth.dart                     # register, login, logout, me\n│   │   └── todos.dart                    # CRUD (all auth-protected)\n│   ├── middleware/\n│   │   └── auth_middleware.dart           # Cookie/session validation\n│   └── utils/\n│       ├── password.dart                 # bcrypt hash/verify\n│       └── session_manager.dart          # Session CRUD\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\n1. Run `duxt dev` to start the server\n2. Test with curl:\n   - Register: `POST /api/auth/register` with `{\"email\",\"password\",\"name\"}` → 201 + cookie\n   - Login: `POST /api/auth/login` → 200 + cookie\n   - Create todo: `POST /api/todos` with cookie → 201\n   - List todos: `GET /api/todos` with cookie → 200\n   - Update todo: `PUT /api/todos/1` → 200\n   - Delete todo: `DELETE /api/todos/1` → 200\n   - No auth: `GET /api/todos` without cookie → 401\n   - Cross-user: Access another user's todo → 404\n   - Logout: `POST /api/auth/logout` → 200, then same token → 401\n\n\nIf you need specific details from before exiting plan mode (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/flakerimi/.claude/projects/-Users-flakerimi/9792aeb2-0c34-47b0-abd0-218b752a8acf.jsonl"
