            "type": "tool_result",
            "content": "Web search results for query: \"jose npm library JWT Node.js modern alternative jsonwebtoken 2025 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"jose - npm\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/jose\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - panva/jose: JWA, JWS, JWE, JWT, JWK, JWKS for Node.js, Browser, Cloudflare Workers, Deno, Bun, and other Web-interoperable runtimes\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/panva/jose\"},{\"title\":\"Jose vs Jsonwebtoken — Why you should switch? | by Joodi | Medium\",\"url\":\"https://joodi.medium.com/jose-vs-jsonwebtoken-why-you-should-switch-4f50dfa3554c\"},{\"title\":\"Why You Should Delete jsonwebtoken in 2025 ⭐ - DEV Community\",\"url\":\"https://dev.to/silentwatcher_95/why-you-should-delete-jsonwebtoken-in-2025-1o7n\"},{\"title\":\"jose - npm search\",\"url\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/search?q=jose\"},{\"title\":\"jws vs jwa vs jose vs jsonwebtoken vs node-jose | JavaScript JWT and JWK Libraries\",\"url\":\"https://npm-compare.com/jose,jsonwebtoken,jwa,jws,node-jose\"},{\"title\":\"jwa vs jose vs jsonwebtoken vs passport-jwt vs express-jwt | JWT Handling Libraries for Node.js Authentication\",\"url\":\"https://npm-compare.com/express-jwt,jose,jsonwebtoken,jwa,passport-jwt\"},{\"title\":\"Top Node.js Libraries for Implementing JSON Web Tokens (JWT)\",\"url\":\"https://moldstud.com/articles/p-top-nodejs-libraries-for-implementing-json-web-tokens-jwt\"},{\"title\":\"JWT.IO - JSON Web Tokens Libraries\",\"url\":\"https://www.jwt.io/libraries\"},{\"title\":\"panva/jose vs auth0/node-jws, auth0/jwt-decode etc · panva/jose · Discussion #577\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/panva/jose/discussions/577\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the **jose** npm library as a modern JWT alternative to jsonwebtoken:\n\n## Overview\n\njose is a JavaScript module for JSON Object Signing and Encryption, providing support for JSON Web Tokens (JWT), JSON Web Signature (JWS), JSON Web Encryption (JWE), JSON Web Key (JWK), JSON Web Key Set (JWKS), and more. The latest version is 6.1.3, last published 3 months ago.\n\n## Key Features\n\njose supports JWA, JWS, JWE, JWT, JWK, JWKS for Node.js, Browser, Cloudflare Workers, Deno, Bun, and other Web-interoperable runtimes. jose has no dependencies and exports tree-shakeable ESM.\n\n## Why Switch from jsonwebtoken?\n\njose is a modern implementation of the JOSE (JavaScript Object Signing and Encryption) standards. While 'jsonwebtoken' offers both synchronous and asynchronous methods, alternatives like 'jose' bring native support for newer encryption standards and are written in modern TypeScript, ensuring stronger type safety and maintainability.\n\nUnlike jsonwebtoken, jose is not a legacy library. It's actively maintained, security-focused, and ready for the current JavaScript ecosystem. Additionally, jose was created by panva, a trusted maintainer in the auth/crypto ecosystem, and you can expect fast updates and solid security.\n\n## Usage Statistics\n\nThere are 3262 other projects in the npm registry using jose.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."
