              "prompt": "Research the best approaches for implementing JWT (JSON Web Token) authentication in Node.js in 2025/2026. I need a comprehensive summary covering:\n\n1. The most popular libraries/packages for JWT in Node.js (jsonwebtoken, jose, passport-jwt, etc.)\n2. Access token + refresh token patterns\n3. Where to store tokens (httpOnly cookies vs localStorage vs memory)\n4. Best practices for signing algorithms (HS256 vs RS256 vs ES256)\n5. Token rotation and revocation strategies\n6. Any newer/modern approaches or libraries that have gained traction\n\nSearch the web for current best practices and summarize the options with pros/cons. Focus on practical recommendations.",
